#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:2
msgid "Classical Solvers"
msgstr "Solucionadors Clàssics"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:4
msgid ""
":mod:`qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers` wraps a handful of purely "
"classical optimizers. They exist so that an optimization problem written "
"as a :class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model` can be solved without a backend, "
"giving you a reference solution to compare a quantum result against."
msgstr ""
":mod:`qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers` embolcalla un grapat "
"d'optimitzadors purament clàssics. Existeixen perquè un problema "
"d'optimització escrit com un :class:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model` es pugui "
"resoldre sense un backend, cosa que et dona una solució de referència amb"
" què comparar un resultat quàntic."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:8
msgid ""
"Every solver subclasses "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver` and"
" exposes a single "
":meth:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver.solve`"
" method that takes a model and returns a "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`."
msgstr ""
"Tots els solucionadors hereten de "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver` i "
"exposen un únic mètode "
":meth:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolver.solve`"
" que pren un model i retorna un "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`."

