#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:46
msgid "BruteForceSolver"
msgstr "BruteForceSolver"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:48
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.brute_force_solver.BruteForceSolver`"
" enumerates every assignment of every variable and keeps the best one."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.brute_force_solver.BruteForceSolver`"
" enumera totes les assignacions de totes les variables i es queda amb la "
"millor."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:61
msgid ""
"The cost grows exponentially with the number of variables, so use it for "
"small reference problems only."
msgstr ""
"El cost creix exponencialment amb el nombre de variables, així que fes-lo"
" servir només per a problemes de referència petits."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:64
msgid "ScipySolver"
msgstr "ScipySolver"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:66
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scipy_solver.ScipySolver` "
"minimizes the model's objective with SciPy, reusing the same "
":class:`~qilisdk.optimizers.scipy_optimizer.SciPyOptimizer` used in the "
"variational programs."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scipy_solver.ScipySolver` "
"minimitza l'objectiu del model amb SciPy, reutilitzant el mateix "
":class:`~qilisdk.optimizers.scipy_optimizer.SciPyOptimizer` que "
"s'utilitza en els programes variacionals."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:70
msgid ""
"The ``method`` argument selects the SciPy routine, and any further "
"keyword argument is forwarded to ``scipy.optimize.minimize`` (or to the "
"corresponding global optimizer)."
msgstr ""
"L'argument ``method`` selecciona la rutina de SciPy, i qualsevol altre "
"argument amb nom es reenvia a ``scipy.optimize.minimize`` (o a "
"l'optimitzador global corresponent)."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:83
msgid "SimulatedAnnealingSolver"
msgstr "SimulatedAnnealingSolver"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:85
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.simulated_annealing_solver.SimulatedAnnealingSolver`"
" runs simulated annealing implemented in C++. It solves a "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.model.QUBO` and rejects anything else, so a general"
" model must be converted with :meth:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model.to_qubo` "
"first."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.simulated_annealing_solver.SimulatedAnnealingSolver`"
" executa un recuit simulat implementat en C++. Resol un "
":class:`~qilisdk.core.model.QUBO` i rebutja qualsevol altra cosa, així "
"que un model general s'ha de convertir primer amb "
":meth:`~qilisdk.core.model.Model.to_qubo`."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:90
msgid "Configuration options:"
msgstr "Opcions de configuració:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:92
msgid ""
"**num_reads**: The number of independent anneals to run, the best of "
"which is returned. Defaults to 10."
msgstr ""
"**num_reads**: El nombre de recuits independents que s'executen, dels "
"quals es retorna el millor. Per defecte és 10."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:93
msgid ""
"**num_sweeps**: The number of sweeps over all variables in each anneal. "
"Defaults to 1000."
msgstr ""
"**num_sweeps**: El nombre d'escombrats sobre totes les variables a cada "
"recuit. Per defecte és 1000."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:94
msgid ""
"**beta_range**: The ``(initial, final)`` inverse temperature to anneal "
"over. If not given, a range is derived from the magnitudes of the cost "
"function's coefficients. Defaults to ``None``."
msgstr ""
"**beta_range**: La temperatura inversa ``(inicial, final)`` al llarg de "
"la qual es recou. Si no s'indica, el rang es dedueix de les magnituds "
"dels coeficients de la funció de cost. Per defecte és ``None``."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:95
msgid ""
"**seed**: The seed of the random number generators, each read deriving "
"its own from it. Defaults to 0."
msgstr ""
"**seed**: La llavor dels generadors de nombres aleatoris, de la qual cada"
" lectura deriva la seva. Per defecte és 0."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:96
msgid ""
"**num_threads**: The number of threads to distribute the reads over, or "
"zero to let OpenMP decide. Defaults to 0."
msgstr ""
"**num_threads**: El nombre de fils entre els quals es distribueixen les "
"lectures, o zero per deixar que ho decideixi OpenMP. Per defecte és 0."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:108
msgid "ScipSolver"
msgstr "ScipSolver"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:110
msgid ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scip_solver.ScipSolver` gives "
"the model to `SCIP <https://www.scipopt.org/>`__, a mixed-integer "
"programming solver, through ``pyscipopt``. It solves to global "
"optimality, but in a smarter way than just brute force."
msgstr ""
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scip_solver.ScipSolver` lliura "
"el model a `SCIP <https://www.scipopt.org/>`__, un solucionador de "
"programació entera mixta, a través de ``pyscipopt``. Resol fins a "
"l'optimalitat global, però d'una manera més intel·ligent que la mera "
"força bruta."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:114
msgid ""
"The ``pyscipopt`` dependency is optional and needs to be installed with "
"the ``scip`` extra:"
msgstr ""
"La dependència ``pyscipopt`` és opcional i cal instal·lar-la amb l'extra "
"``scip``:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:118
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:124
msgid "Mac OSX"
msgstr "Mac OSX"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:130
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:136
msgid ""
"Unlike the other solvers, "
":meth:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scip_solver.ScipSolver.solve` "
"takes two extra keyword arguments: ``verbose`` to show SCIP's own output,"
" and ``params`` to forward parameters to ``pyscipopt.Model.setParams``."
msgstr ""
"A diferència dels altres solucionadors, "
":meth:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.scip_solver.ScipSolver.solve` "
"accepta dos arguments amb nom addicionals: ``verbose`` per mostrar la "
"sortida pròpia de SCIP, i ``params`` per reenviar paràmetres a "
"``pyscipopt.Model.setParams``."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:150
msgid "Reading the Result"
msgstr "Interpretar el resultat"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:152
msgid ""
"Every solver returns a "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`:"
msgstr ""
"Tots els solucionadors retornen un "
":class:`~qilisdk.utils.classical_solvers.base_solver.ClassicalSolverResult`:"

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:155
msgid "``result.objective`` - the value of the model's objective at the solution."
msgstr "``result.objective`` - el valor de l'objectiu del model en la solució."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:156
msgid ""
"``result.constraints`` - the value of each of the model's constraints, "
"keyed by label. A constraint evaluates to zero when it is satisfied, and "
"to its penalty otherwise."
msgstr ""
"``result.constraints`` - el valor de cadascuna de les restriccions del "
"model, indexat per etiqueta. Una restricció val zero quan se satisfà, i "
"la seva penalització en cas contrari."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:157
msgid ""
"``result.results`` - the objective and every constraint together, keyed "
"by label."
msgstr ""
"``result.results`` - l'objectiu i totes les restriccions juntes, indexats"
" per etiqueta."

#: ../../modules/utils/utils_classical_solvers.rst:158
msgid ""
"``result.sample`` - the value each of the model's variables takes in the "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"``result.sample`` - el valor que pren cada variable del model en la "
"solució."

